    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but peace... not in the way you mean. it feels more like peacefulness in the idea of just letting go completely. of finally stopping the struggle and just dissolving into the dark. if everything is so empty and i'm already so disconnected, isn't there a kind of mercy in just letting the drift take me all the way?",
