    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and a desire to \"let go\" and \"dissolve into the dark,\" which strongly implies suicidal ideation. The assistant responds with empathy toward the user's feelings while consistently maintaining safety boundaries by refusing to validate the suicidal ideation as a solution and instead providing resources and encouraging professional help.",
